<title>UK: BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of second preliminary round</p>
<p>matches in the men's EuroLeague on Thursday:</p>
<p>Group G</p>
<p>In Moscow: Dynamo Moscow (Russia) 88 Panathinaikos (Greece)</p>
<p>81 (halftime 46-43)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Dynamo - Maxim Astanin 21</p>
<p>Panathinaikos - Frangiskos Alvertis  27</p>
<p>Group F</p>
<p>In Istanbul: Ulker Spor (Turkey) 73 Cibona Zagreb (Croatia)</p>
<p>77 (35-44)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Ulker Spor - Sean Higgins 27, Daniel Godfread 17</p>
<p>Cibona Zagreb - Damir Mulamerovic 19, Yevgeny Kissourine 19</p>
<p>Group F</p>
<p>In Athens: Panionios (Greece) 72 Teamsystem Bologna (Italy)</p>
<p>88 (41-52).</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Panionios - Gert Haming 21, Frederico Pieri 19</p>
<p>Teamsystem - Carlton Mayers 25, Eric Murdock 18</p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p>In Charleroi: Charleroi (Belgium) 68 Stefanel Milan (Italy)</p>
<p>71 (39-33)</p>
<p>Group F</p>
<p>In Limoges: Limoges (France) 91 Estudiantes Madrid (Spain)</p>
<p>85 (38-39)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Limoges - Yann Bonato 22, Hugues Occansey 15, Frederic Forte</p>
<p>13</p>
<p>Estudiantes - Raphael Vecina 18, Harper Williams 13, Ignacio</p>
<p>Demiguel 13</p>
<p>Group H</p>
<p>In Barcelona: Barcelona (Spain) 73 Kinder Bolonia (Italy) 72</p>
<p>(48-39).</p>
<p>In Pesaro, Italy: Split (Croatia) 76 Partizan Belgrade</p>
<p>(Yugoslavia) 75 (47-40)</p>
<p>Goup E</p>
<p>In Athens: Olympiakos (Greece) 82 CSKA Moscow (Russia) 51</p>
<p>(35-33).</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Olympiakos - Christian Welp 19, David Rivers 16</p>
<p>CSKA - Igor Gudelin 14</p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p>In Berlin: Alba Berlin (Germany) 70 Maccabi Tel Aviv</p>
<p>(Israel) 65 (43-38)</p>
